{"id":"70b8760b956021f4","group":"56","path":"56/56-prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence.md","title":"Rewriting under type elimination","display":"prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence — Rewriting under type elimination","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence","aliases":["56-prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence"],"display":"prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence — Rewriting under type elimination","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting]]","[[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-terminating]]"],"source_section":"§6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"257–258","source_ocr_blocks":[278,279],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-many-sorted-forgetting-step-correspondence — Rewriting under type elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e959f58a71a7a2f\" href=\"?note=1e959f58a71a7a2f\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting\">56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"629f88abafad3e3c\" href=\"?note=629f88abafad3e3c\" title=\"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation\">56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"257–258"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>278</span><span>279</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\bullet\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\bullet\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_s\">\\(T_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;\">\\(\\Sigma&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\">\\(T&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\Theta}\">\\(R^{\\Theta}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e959f58a71a7a2f\" href=\"?note=1e959f58a71a7a2f\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting\">56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting</a>；排序保持见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"629f88abafad3e3c\" href=\"?note=629f88abafad3e3c\" title=\"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation\">56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^S\">\\(\\to_R^S\\)</span> 使用排序一步关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{R^{\\Theta}}\\subseteq T&#39;\\times T&#39;\">\\(\\to_{R^{\\Theta}}\\subseteq T&#39;\\times T&#39;\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a> 在签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;\">\\(\\Sigma&#39;\\)</span>、变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\Theta}\">\\(R^{\\Theta}\\)</span> 上的无排序一步关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}\">\\(\\mathrm{Terminating}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a> 的二元关系终止性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t,u\\in T_S\\;(\\Theta(t)=\\Theta(u)\\Rightarrow t=u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t,u\\in T_S\\;(\\Theta(t)=\\Theta(u)\\Rightarrow t=u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t,u\\in T_s\\;\n(t\\to_R^S u\\iff\\Theta(t)\\to_{R^{\\Theta}}\\Theta(u)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t,u\\in T_s\\;\n(t\\to_R^S u\\iff\\Theta(t)\\to_{R^{\\Theta}}\\Theta(u)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\,\\forall v\\in T&#39;\\;\n\\bigl(\\Theta(t)\\to_{R^{\\Theta}}v\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u\\in T_s\\;(t\\to_R^S u\\land\\Theta(u)=v)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\,\\forall v\\in T&#39;\\;\n\\bigl(\\Theta(t)\\to_{R^{\\Theta}}v\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u\\in T_s\\;(t\\to_R^S u\\land\\Theta(u)=v)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T&#39;,\\to_{R^{\\Theta}})\n\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_S,\\to_R^S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminating}(T&#39;,\\to_{R^{\\Theta}})\n\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_S,\\to_R^S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为双射且变量不变，按项结构归纳得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 的单射性。它也保持位置、位置截取以及替换子项的形状。给定排序替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，令无排序替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(x)=\\Theta(\\sigma(x))\">\\(\\tau(x)=\\Theta(\\sigma(x))\\)</span>；结构归纳得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta(t\\sigma)=\\Theta(t)\\tau\">\\(\\Theta(t\\sigma)=\\Theta(t)\\tau\\)</span>，从而每个排序一步映成无排序一步。</p>\n<p>反向取无排序一步的规则、位置和替换见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>。其源子项来自排序项，且匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta(l)\">\\(\\Theta(l)\\)</span>。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 的结构归纳：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 中出现的每个变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V_q\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V_q\\)</span> 的匹配像都等于某个唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_x\\in T_q\">\\(v_x\\in T_q\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 像。重复变量的匹配一致性与单射性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_x\">\\(v_x\\)</span> 的选择一致。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(x)=v_x\">\\(\\sigma(x)=v_x\\)</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(l)\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\)</span>，并在其他变量上取恒等；这给出总排序替换。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\)</span>，右项映像也与原无排序替换一致。对位置替换归纳，再用类型保持，即得同排序的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 及第三式；第二式随之成立。</p>\n<p>若排序系统有无限归约，则逐项应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 得到遗忘系统的无限归约，故最后一式成立。本命题的第三式仅限制于良排序源项；它没有排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\\setminus T&#39;_{\\mathrm{wt}}\">\\(T&#39;\\setminus T&#39;_{\\mathrm{wt}}\\)</span> 上的无限归约，不能据此反推遗忘系统终止。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§6.5.6，印刷第257页，OCR页块278，明确给出同排序项的一步对应；印刷第258页，OCR页块279，指出无限排序归约可直接翻译，故遗忘系统终止蕴含排序系统终止。单射性和良排序源项的目标闭合是本地展开，证明已如上复核。未在此声称无附加条件的反向终止蕴含。OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting","status":"resolved","id":"1e959f58a71a7a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"629f88abafad3e3c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting","status":"resolved","id":"1e959f58a71a7a2f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$T_s$、$T_S$、$R$、$\\Sigma'$、$T'$、$\\Theta$ 与 $R^{\\Theta}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting]]；排序保持见 [[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"629f88abafad3e3c","anchor":"